  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "miniature adventure",
  "premise": "A tiny traveler wants to retrieve a lost flag caught on a sweater, but every knitted loop looks like the same hill. They follow a single contrasting thread through the fabric, reach the flag, and discover the mountain rises only because a sleeping pet is breathing beneath it.",
